- Views: `return c.view("posts/index", .{ .posts = rows }, .{});` renders
  `src/features/posts/views/index.html`. `{ expr }` is HTML-escaped; pass
  trusted markup built in Zig as `spider.RawHtml{ .html = s }`. htmx partials:
  `c.viewFragment("posts/index", "PostsList", data, .{})`.
- Templates are compiled into the binary: rebuild (and restart) after editing.
- **Styling: ui-* classes + Tailwind utilities, nothing else.** Components come
  from `src/ui.css`: `ui-btn` (+ `ui-btn-primary`, `ui-btn-ghost`,
  `ui-btn-error`, `ui-btn-sm`, `ui-btn-square`), forms as
  `<label class="ui-field"><span class="ui-label">Name</span><input class="ui-input" name="name"></label>`
  (`ui-textarea`, `ui-select`), `ui-card`, `ui-badge`, `ui-menu` /
  `ui-menu-title`, `ui-alert` (+ `-success`, `-error`), `ui-toast`. Never use a
  kit's own classes (`btn`, `card`, `input`, ...): only `src/ui.css` knows the
  kit, and `spider ui use <kit>` swaps it. Need a new reusable style? Add a
  `ui-*` class to `src/ui.css`. Colors use the theme names every kit defines:
  `bg-base-100/200/300`, `text-base-content` (`/50` for muted), `primary`,
  `error`, `success`, `warning`. No inline `style=` for layout or color.
- **Icons are classes:** `<span class="hero-pencil-square size-5"></span>`
  (Heroicons; `-solid`, `-mini`, `-micro` variants; names at heroicons.com).
  They take the text color. Never paste `<svg>` markup or use emoji as icons.
  Other sets: `spider icons add lucide` (`lucide-*`) / `tabler` (`tabler-*`).
- PWA (only if `public/manifest.webmanifest` exists — `spider add pwa`): the
  service worker `public/sw.js` only serves `/offline.html` when a page can't
  load, plus push notifications; keep it that way (never cache pages, API or
  htmx responses — stale HTML is the classic PWA bug) and bump its VERSION
  when you change it. Never just delete sw.js: `spider remove pwa`.
- Interactivity: htmx attributes for server round-trips, Alpine (`x-data`,
  `@click`, `$store.toast.fire(msg)`, `$store.layout`) for local UI state.
